  "description": "Pure-managed Windows icon (ICO) and cursor (CUR) decoder and encoder for .NET. Reads every image of the directory, each a PNG stream or a DIB with its AND mask (1/4/8/16/24/32-bit, through Sdcb.SimdCodecs.Bmp), with cursor hotspots; picks the largest, deepest image by default and opens all of them as frames. Writes multi-size icons and cursors, each image PNG or 1/4/8/24/32-bit BMP. AOT-compatible.",
